//# script-feature-level(2)

/*
	Online Co-op mod for Sonic 3 A.I.R.
	Requires the Co-op edition of the game (engine with the "Net.*" script functions).

	File overview:
	 - coop_defines:  constants, memory layout, settings variables
	 - coop_session:  starting the session from coop.json, status display
	 - coop_stage:    everyone follows the host's stage
	 - coop_players:  sending own character state and drawing everyone else

	Future-proofing rules followed in this mod:
	 - Never copy-and-edit base game functions. Only use own hook functions or
	   overrides that call "base." so game updates flow through.
	 - All network message layouts live in coop_defines with a protocol version,
	   bump COOP_SIGNATURE whenever a layout changes.
*/

include coop_defines
include coop_session
include coop_stage
include coop_players
